{
 "part": "script/script_0080",
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0BC2",
   "src": "cbd968f0946b",
   "t": "<FACE:31>Oigaaan… ¿está bien<NL>que hagan esto?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0BDD",
   "src": "36b5f3a2f1dd",
   "t": "<FACE:7F>¡Todo bien-robo!<WAIT><FACE:31>Peroo… ¿y si viene un<NL>jefe y los regaña?<WAIT>No se preocupen por<NL>Urin, a trabajar"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0C21",
   "src": "235734b9ca48",
   "t": "<FACE:7F>Urin es buenísima-robo<NL>¡se preocupa por uno!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0C48",
   "src": "fe67ec804816",
   "t": "<FACE:32>(Tsk…)<WAIT>(No aguanto más a<NL>estos tipos)<WAIT>(Que se pongan a<NL>trabajar de una vez…)"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0C8B",
   "src": "1bc24822a3b4",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>¿Qué pasa-robo?<NL>¿Te sientes mal-robo?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0CA3",
   "src": "a96499b92e17",
   "t": "<FACE:31>¿Eh? No es nadaa"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0CB1",
   "src": "11c2138d7da5",
   "t": "<FACE:7F>Menos mal-robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0CBB",
   "src": "73f74e5da2f7",
   "t": "<FACE:31>Peroo, este lugar…<NL>¿no está muy polvoso?<WAIT>A Urin le duele la<NL>gargantaaa"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0CE3",
   "src": "4f326ec41c78",
   "t": "<FACE:80>¡Espera un poco-robo!<NL>¡Traigo agua-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0D04",
   "src": "dbfe1cadde77",
   "t": "<FACE:32>Ay, ya no aguanto…<NL>Un chico guapo, vaya<WAIT>pero ¿por qué hacerme<NL>la linda con bichos…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0D4C",
   "src": "1486c50c0b77",
   "t": "<FACE:7F>¡Urin, te traje<NL>agua-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0D62",
   "src": "1f1c415a113a",
   "t": "<FACE:7E>¡¿Qué haces-robo?!<NL><WAIT>¡Urin tomará el agua<NL>que traje yo-robo!<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0D84",
   "src": "11f9feaa44ef",
   "t": "<FACE:7E>¡Que no-robo!<NL>¡Es la mía-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0D95",
   "src": "f61002884d2d",
   "t": "<FACE:31>Está bien, chicos…<NL>Urin ya está mejoor"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0DB3",
   "src": "a5785827bb75",
   "t": "<FACE:31>¿Estará roto el filtro<NL>de aire del bloque?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0DD1",
   "src": "7a54bac80354",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>Ni modo-robo<NL>Este bloque es así"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0DEB",
   "src": "ee4786a4b5ef",
   "t": "<FACE:31>Buuu…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0DF2",
   "src": "b2070a6bd36c",
   "t": "<FACE:80>Q-qué linda-robo…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0DFF",
   "src": "639a5ec97cbe",
   "t": "<FACE:7F>¡Qué linda-robo!<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0E0A",
   "src": "0d9851765d80",
   "t": "<FACE:7F>¡Pero también hay algo<NL>bueno-robo!<WAIT><FACE:31>¿Algo buenoo?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0E25",
   "src": "a5390c1e3365",
   "t": "<FACE:7F>Nuestro jefe Smog es<NL>de salud débil-robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0E45",
   "src": "f34a146802a1",
   "t": "<FACE:7F>Como el bloque es así<NL>Smog no viene-robo<WAIT>¡Y por eso podemos<NL>jugar con Urin-roboo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0E79",
   "src": "f8906be051d2",
   "t": "<FACE:08>¿¡Qué!?<NL><WAIT>¿Qué es este bloque<NL>tan polvoriento?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0E91",
   "src": "a6ea057e4185",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>Tienes razón…<NL><WAIT>Aunque sea una prueba,<NL>tanto polvo sobra…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0EC4",
   "src": "97233adffa8c",
   "t": "<FACE:1D>Aquí el filtro de aire<NL>está descompuesto<WAIT><FACE:14>Si nos quedamos mucho<NL>nos hará daño, líder"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0EF9",
   "src": "16a12e18ae8f",
   "t": "<FACE:03>Espérenme… uf, uf…<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0F0D",
   "src": "27317a443322",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Uf… un respiro…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0F19",
   "src": "e735c25408f7",
   "t": "<FACE:03>¡Cof! ¡Cof, cof…!<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0F28",
   "src": "fd9fb7e001b9",
   "t": "<FACE:04>¿¡Q-qué es esto…!?<NL>Cuánto polvo… cof,<WAIT>cof"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0F46",
   "src": "f64f90cdab4f",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>Como sea, hay que<NL>recuperar este bloque"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0F64",
   "src": "907f63d2f0bc",
   "t": "<FACE:7F>¡Ahora te toca a ti,<NL>Urin-robo!<WAIT><FACE:31>Esperen, Sperobitos…<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0F8C",
   "src": "5a55b9f359df",
   "t": "<FACE:31>¡Ajá! Te atrapé…<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0F9B",
   "src": "696099bd5710",
   "t": "<FACE:31>¡Ah! Si es <PLAYER>…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0FA8",
   "src": "b6d3aa8b2261",
   "t": "<FACE:00>¿Qué pasa, Hiyori?<WAIT><FACE:09>Esa chica no me gusta…<NL>Siempre me provoca…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0FDA",
   "src": "ac627a44225d",
   "t": "<FACE:31>¡Pero si es la<NL>señorita Koharubi!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:0FEC",
   "src": "6b2e77890689",
   "t": "<FACE:07>A-ay, qué casualidad…<NL>¿Qué hacías por aquí?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:100C",
   "src": "ad1a37f94085",
   "t": "<FACE:32>(Ya me estaba<NL>aburriendo de aquí…)<WAIT><WAIT>(Pero si Hiyori me<NL>salva, sube su fama…)"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:104D",
   "src": "f4a68270e80c",
   "t": "<FACE:31>(¡Ya sé! Los azuzo<NL> y escapo en el lío)"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:1073",
   "src": "75f218b82307",
   "t": "<FACE:7E>¿¡A qué vinieron<NL>ustedes-robo!?<NL><WAIT><FACE:01>¡Está claro!<NL>¡Recuperar el bloque!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:10A6",
   "src": "0b121c635db8",
   "t": "<FACE:32>(Uy, qué bien va esto)"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:10B8",
   "src": "aac562cf07d4",
   "t": "<FACE:7E>¡No lo permitiré-robo!<NL><WAIT>¡Este lugar es de Urin<NL>y de nosotros-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:10DF",
   "src": "3a68102ef955",
   "t": "<FACE:06>¿Qué gusto le da<NL>rodearse de esos…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:10FF",
   "src": "aed14c459529",
   "t": "<FACE:32>(¿¡Quééé!? Si es así…)"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:1113",
   "src": "425d0691ca60",
   "t": "<FACE:31>Oigaan…<NL><WAIT>A Urin no le gusta<NL>esta gente…<WAIT>Urin quiere jugar más<NL>con los Sperobitos…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:1141",
   "src": "59ff47848d7b",
   "t": "<FACE:80>¡U-Urin!<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:114E",
   "src": "a3d8873b1f32",
   "t": "<FACE:7F>¡Entendido-robo!<NL><WAIT>¡Defenderemos juntos<NL>nuestro bloque-robo!<WAIT>¡Peleemos juntos-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:1187",
   "src": "0d8def90584d",
   "t": "<FACE:31>(¡¿Eh?! ¡¿Por qué?!)<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:1196",
   "src": "16b112d79bf0",
   "t": "<FACE:31>(Buaa… ¿por qué me<NL> pasa esto?)"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:11AB",
   "src": "f8a601648035",
   "t": "<FACE:81>N-nos ganaron-robo…<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:11B9",
   "src": "7caad7515ce9",
   "t": "<FACE:7E>¡No-robo! Si cedemos<NL>Urin se pondrá triste<WAIT>¡Eso es-robo!<NL><WAIT>¡No hay bloque mejor<NL>para flojear-robo!<WAIT>¡No nos rendimos-robo!<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:1209",
   "src": "52bb6d805529",
   "t": "<FACE:7E>¡Mira bien-robo!<NL>¡Todo por Urin-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:1227",
   "src": "a201328241bf",
   "t": "<FACE:81>P-perdimos-roboo…<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:1234",
   "src": "c845896ca8e5",
   "t": "<FACE:80>Adiós a la buena vida<NL>de flojear-roboo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:124D",
   "src": "3503c9f3b0dc",
   "t": "<FACE:31>(¿Q-qué hago…?)<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:125C",
   "src": "1fd97a61636b",
   "t": "<FACE:31>(B-bueno, entonces…)"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:126B",
   "src": "2a7731af89c7",
   "t": "<FACE:31>¡L-lo sientooo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:1278",
   "src": "10dbb0d394fb",
   "t": "<FACE:05>¡¿«Lo shientooo»?!<NL>¿Y ya con eso basta?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:129A",
   "src": "dbdf588a8504",
   "t": "<FACE:31>Esos me amenazaron…<NL>¡No me quedaba otraa!<WAIT><FACE:09>¿Amenazada, dices…?<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:12C3",
   "src": "7c5e8f66d8bc",
   "t": "<FACE:09>Oye…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:12CA",
   "src": "2f0bde1222f5",
   "t": "<FACE:31><PLAYER>, tú sí<NL>me entiendes,<WAIT>¿verdad?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:12DE",
   "src": "dd7367582d1b",
   "t": "<FACE:31>¿Sí? ¿¡Sí!? ¡¡Sí!!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:12EB",
   "src": "08aeb59f884f",
   "t": "<FACE:03>E-espera…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:12F7",
   "src": "c9690a29b582",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Uf… bueno,<NL>ya pidió perdón, ¿no?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:1313",
   "src": "6ab08e6f6b79",
   "t": "<FACE:31>¡Yupiii!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:131A",
   "src": "277276eab06c",
   "t": "<FACE:03>¡Uy…!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:1322",
   "src": "1785c02a17cc",
   "t": "<FACE:08>¡¡Oye!! …Urin…<WAIT><FACE:06><PLAYER> se está<NL>ahogando, ¡¿no ves?!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:1351",
   "src": "4d8bb6c09a87",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Uuuf…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:1359",
   "src": "48d58902f237",
   "t": "<FACE:0E><PLAYER> también la<NL>pasa mal…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:1367",
   "src": "4e1f92f5906b",
   "t": "<FACE:31>¡Urin se unió al<NL>equipo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0080:1378",
   "src": "f1523898e8aa",
   "t": "<FACE:06>¡Vaya! ¡Parece que no<NL>te disgustó tanto!"
  }
 ]
}
